==Description==
The '''Cultist Runes Nametag''' is a nametag that could have been obtained at Level 32 of the premium [[Null & Void Event#Null & Void Battle Pass|Null & Void Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{GumDrops|900}} or {{Robux|64}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{GumDrops|13,115}} or {{Robux|2,280}}. Prior to the 20% discount, it had a cost of {{Robux|80}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{Robux|2,865}}.

The '''Cultist Runes Nametag''' has purple gradient text with a dark purple outline. A black and purple fog with small purple sparks appears behind the text. The text is surrounded by multiple runes used by the [[Rift Walker]].

